Reveal the trap card.

253
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:40,540
Last turn.

254
00:14:41,720 --> 00:14:44,040
It all comes down to this.

255
00:14:44,280 --> 00:14:45,440
What's going on?

256
00:14:45,920 --> 00:14:47,560
Watch this, Moguva.

257
00:14:48,420 --> 00:14:50,008
Here's how it's gonna work.

258
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:52,957
Each of us will pick a
monster to keep on the field,

259
00:14:53,040 --> 00:14:55,877
and all others will go
directly to the graveyard.

260
00:14:55,960 --> 00:14:58,357
Then the two chosen
monsters will face each

261
00:14:58,440 --> 00:15:00,969
other in a one-on-one
battle to the finish.

262
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:06,640
When the fight is over, only one of
our monsters will remain standing.

263
00:15:07,140 --> 00:15:11,017
The winner of this one battle will
determine who wins the entire duel,

264
00:15:11,100 --> 00:15:13,357
no matter how many life
points he has left.

265
00:15:13,440 --> 00:15:15,580
May the strongest duelist win.

266
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:17,700
I choose my Blue Eyes.

267
00:15:19,020 --> 00:15:24,080
Alright, I choose my Deck Master,
the all-powerful Shenado's Ark.

268
00:15:26,240 --> 00:15:30,797
It's time for me to sink your
ship now and finish you off.

269
00:15:30,880 --> 00:15:36,060
Blue-Eyes White Dragon, attack his
Deckmaster with White Lightning attack!

270
00:15:43,940 --> 00:15:45,900
Better abandon ship!

271
00:15:47,900 --> 00:15:50,040
Kaiba won! Wrong!

272
00:15:50,700 --> 00:15:51,980
Look again!

273
00:15:53,500 --> 00:15:57,360
You've just unleashed a power
like nothing you've ever seen!

274
00:15:57,760 --> 00:15:58,590
What is that?

275
00:15:58,673 --> 00:16:02,160
It's my real Deckmaster! No way!

276
00:16:03,340 --> 00:16:05,800
You've just sealed your own doom, Seto!

277
00:16:06,020 --> 00:16:11,260
For when you destroyed Shinado's Ark, you
released Shinado, king of a higher blade!

278
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:17,700
Now prepare to experience the
power of my real Deckmaster!

279
00:16:19,640 --> 00:16:20,780
Shinado, attack!

280
00:16:27,580 --> 00:16:28,780
Seto! Oh, no!

281
00:16:30,300 --> 00:16:31,420
Ha ha ha ha!

282
00:16:31,860 --> 00:16:34,320
Seto, I've finally done it!

283
00:16:34,640 --> 00:16:37,540
I've proven that I'm superior to you!

284
00:16:37,900 --> 00:16:39,371
Did you see that, Father?

285
00:16:39,460 --> 00:16:40,700
I defeated Seto!

286
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:44,697
Now I can finally take over
Kaivacorp like I was always meant to!

287
00:16:44,780 --> 00:16:47,517
For I am the most powerful
being in the world!

288
00:16:47,600 --> 00:16:51,440
Now to perform one final task
before I exit this place!

289
00:16:52,160 --> 00:16:54,700
What's Dad Freak doing? Ready?

290
00:16:54,940 --> 00:16:59,800
I'll now merge together with my Deck Master
to deliver the last blow of this duel.

291
00:17:00,340 --> 00:17:05,180
You see, I've decided not to escape
to the real world in your body, Seto,

292
00:17:05,460 --> 00:17:08,100
since I have so many
others to choose from.

293
00:17:09,100 --> 00:17:11,160
Besides, that's no fun.

294
00:17:11,480 --> 00:17:12,857
I've got bigger plans.

295
00:17:12,940 --> 00:17:18,700
Shinato and I want to turn you into a
permanent fixture in this virtual world. Hey!

296
00:17:20,960 --> 00:17:22,360
Seto! Mokuba.

297
00:17:23,300 --> 00:17:27,712
This reunion is touching, but I'm afraid
I'm going to have to cut it short.

298
00:17:30,180 --> 00:17:31,010
No!

299
00:17:32,120 --> 00:17:34,060
My job is now complete.

300
00:17:34,860 --> 00:17:35,840
Taiba! Mokuba!

301
00:17:36,700 --> 00:17:38,060
What did he do to them?

302
00:17:38,260 --> 00:17:43,201
I always thought they were hard-headed, So
I've turned them into a living sculpture.

303
00:17:43,480 --> 00:17:47,100
They're so close, yet they'll
never reach one another.

304
00:17:47,400 --> 00:17:49,680
How tragic. Oh, man.

305
00:17:50,920 --> 00:17:51,900
They're statues.

306
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:53,160
It can't be.

307
00:17:56,160 --> 00:17:59,217
Noah, you think this
proves you're the best?

308
00:17:59,300 --> 00:18:02,241
I think it shows your
father that you're a coward.

309
00:18:02,500 --> 00:18:04,540
What are you talking about, Yugi?

310
00:18:04,780 --> 00:18:07,580
I defeated Seto in this
duel fair and square.

311
00:18:07,960 --> 00:18:09,019
Guess again, Noah.

312
00:18:09,500 --> 00:18:13,147
You think kidnapping Mokuba and
using him as a shield is fair?

313
00:18:13,420 --> 00:18:14,780
You think I cheated?

314
00:18:15,020 --> 00:18:19,477
I think you're guilty of the same foul
play you once scolded the Big Five for.

315
00:18:19,560 --> 00:18:22,442
Something you said your
father would never allow.

316
00:18:22,900 --> 00:18:25,257
Kaiba could have easily
defeated you, Noah.

317
00:18:25,340 --> 00:18:29,037
But he chose the safety of his
little brother over his victory.

318
00:18:29,120 --> 00:18:33,460
And that makes Kaiba a stronger
person than you will ever be.

319
00:18:33,680 --> 00:18:35,897
All you've proven here
today is that you're a

320
00:18:35,980 --> 00:18:38,897
weak little boy who needs
to cheat to get his way.

321
00:18:38,980 --> 00:18:41,557
and as far as i'm concerned you didn't win

322
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:44,860
this duel but i have a proposition for you

323
00:18:45,660 --> 00:18:50,497
taiba has 400 life points left
let me take his place so we

324
00:18:50,580 --> 00:18:53,877
can finish this duel there in
square huh that could be the

325
00:18:53,960 --> 00:18:56,877
most foolish challenge i've
ever heard does that mean you'll

326
00:18:56,960 --> 00:18:59,857
accept or are you afraid i'll
defeat you and prove once

327
00:18:59,940 --> 00:19:04,417
and for all that you are weak
i'd be crazy not to except

328
00:19:04,500 --> 00:19:09,397
yuki don't be a doofus he's got
over 7 000 life points to your

329
00:19:09,480 --> 00:19:13,837
measly 400 careful joey's right
for a change once i defeat

330
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:19,160
you yuki i'll turn every one
of you into stone just try it

331
00:19:20,020 --> 00:19:26,057
i think we need a little privacy don't
you what's he doing as i was saying

332
00:19:26,140 --> 00:19:31,460
i'll turn all but one of you into stone
after all i need a body to escape it

333
00:19:34,140 --> 00:19:37,040
And if you lose, you'll set us all free.

334
00:19:37,380 --> 00:19:40,760
So in the name of Kaiba
and Mokuba, let's duel now!

335
00:19:41,220 --> 00:19:42,680
With pleasure, Yuki.

336
00:19:42,940 --> 00:19:45,900
And may the best duelist win. You're on!

337
00:19:46,260 --> 00:19:51,580
And when I do, you and your friends
will be prisoners of my world forever!

338
00:20:21,740 --> 00:20:23,280
Yu-Gi-Oh!
